Grounding note
  The three flight records under worker_result.evidence were retrieved by the
  flight backend from the flight database service over HTTP and passed to the
  agents as context.evidence. The Worker selected flight_id 2 (Jetstar, 109.0),
  which is the lowest priced record in that evidence set. The Reviewer verified
  the recommendation against the same evidence and returned Accept.

