5. HUMAN REVIEW DECISION
================================================================================
$ curl -s -X POST "http://127.0.0.1:5005/api/flight/multi-agent/workflow/$WF/review" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{"decision":"Partially Accept","correction":"Prefer a morning departure where price difference is under $50"}' \
    | python3 -m json.tool

    "human_decision": {
        "correction": "Prefer a morning departure where price difference is under $50",
        "decision": "Partially Accept",
        "required": true,
        "status": "completed",
        "timestamp": "2026-10-22T05:50:56.391346+00:00"
    },
    "status": "completed",

The workflow paused at pending_review until a human decision was supplied.
The decision and correction are recorded against the workflow with a timestamp.

