7. HUMAN REVIEW VALIDATION (NEGATIVE CASES)
================================================================================
$ curl -o /dev/null -s -w "invalid decision: %{http_code}\n" -X POST \
    "http://127.0.0.1:5005/api/flight/multi-agent/workflow/$WF/review" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"decision":"Maybe"}'
