$ curl -o /dev/null -s -w "partial without correction: %{http_code}\n" -X POST \
    "http://127.0.0.1:5005/api/flight/multi-agent/workflow/$WF/review" \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"decision":"Partially Accept","correction":""}'
partial without correction: 400

Only Accept, Partially Accept and Reject are permitted, and a partial
acceptance requires a correction.

